  "items": [
    {
      "name": "What floaters actually are",
      "char_file": "손가락_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Specks, threads, or cobwebs",
        "drifting across your vision",
        "",
        "come from clumps in the",
        "vitreous, the gel inside your eye",
        "",
        "Aging is the top cause -",
        "high myopia or diabetes raise the risk"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "First, aging",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "As the vitreous ages, it turns",
        "from gel-like to watery",
        "",
        "and pulls away from the retina -",
        "a posterior vitreous detachment",
        "",
        "By age 65, most people",
        "have gone through this"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Aging floaters, handled like this",
      "char_file": "물방울_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "No drop or pill removes them -",
        "your brain adapts over time",
        "",
        "Looking up, then back down",
        "can shift one out of view"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Second, myopia and diabetes",
      "char_file": "혈당계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Severe nearsightedness thins",
        "the retina, raising tear risk",
        "",
        "Diabetic retinopathy can bleed",
        "into the vitreous as it progresses"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "General eye care still helps",
      "char_file": "선글라스_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Floaters aside, your eyes",
        "still benefit from basic care",
        "",
        "Every 20 minutes, look",
        "20 feet away for 20 seconds",
        "",
        "Sunglasses outdoors and leafy greens",
        "like kale supply lutein and zeaxanthin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "What one study found",
      "char_file": "영양제_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A small 6-month study tried",
        "an antioxidant nutrient blend",
        "",
        "About 70% of participants",
        "reported smaller, less bothersome floaters",
        "",
        "It's not a cure, and",
        "results like this need more research"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "These signs need an eye doctor",
      "char_file": "폭죽_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A sudden shower of new floaters,",
        "flashes of light,",
        "",
        "or a curtain-like shadow",
        "over part of your vision",
        "",
        "can signal a retinal tear -",
        "see an eye doctor right away"
      ]
    }
  ],
